  <p id="c-jinshu-010-wang080-xianzhi:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">義熙八年
八月，<persName id="c-jinshu-010-wang080-xianzhi:death:m0008" ref="sm1_jfi_7k2_A">皇后王氏</persName>崩。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-010-wang080-xianzhi:burial" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">義熙八年
